WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.792
Welcome to Sentinel Fleet.

2
00:00:01.792 --> 00:00:06.273
The customer overview shows fleet health without hiding privacy controls.

3
00:00:06.273 --> 00:00:12.545
Refresh positions to create a new demo telemetry snapshot, then open the live map.

4
00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:20.610
From the vehicle directory, choose Telematics to inspect the saved current state, trip history, and decoded device logs.

5
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:25.090
These views stay useful even when a tracker goes offline.
